    {
      "type": "Note",
      "size": [
        1000,
        550
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "RAWGIRL + OPTIONAL NMKD UPSCALE\nOriginal generation is unchanged: RawGirl model, Millie 0.80, prompt, ClownsharKSampler, seed, VAE and base dimensions.\nUPSCALE = true by default. false bypasses both NMKD and resize; BASE goes directly to the result saver/comparer.\nThe model enlarges 4x. FINAL SIZE then uses Lanczos:\n0.50 -> net 2x (1080x1920 base -> 2160x3840)\n0.375 -> net 1.5x (1080x1920 base -> 1620x2880)\n0.25 -> net 1x (same size, processed textures)\nSizes follow the actual decoded BASE dimensions. Aspect ratio is preserved up to pixel rounding.\nSAVE BASE always saves original decoded pixels. SAVE UPSCALE RESULT saves the selected output; if OFF it saves another BASE copy.\nComparer A is BASE; B is selected result. Open saved files at 100% to assess texture and sharpening at native sizes.\nNo second diffusion pass, no FaceDetailer, no Color Match added.\nRequired upscale model: 4xNMKDSuperscale_4xNMKDSuperscale.pt in ComfyUI/models/upscale_models, or select your installed NMKD 4x equivalent.\nAdditional nodes: LazySwitchKJ (ComfyUI-KJNodes) and Image Comparer (rgthree-comfy).\nThe x4 intermediate image still consumes memory even when the final result is 2x. Fine textures may change; compare before accepting the result.\nGraph/parameter checks passed. GPU rendering has not been tested."
      ],
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
